---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Boudoir Photography Auckland"
  description="How Boudoir Photography Auckland collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="bg-boudoir-ink py-20 text-boudoir-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-6 py-16 text-boudoir-muted">
    <p>
      Your privacy matters, especially given the personal nature of this
      work. This page explains what information is collected through this
      website and how it's used, in line with the New Zealand Privacy Act.
    </p>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">What I collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        When you use the contact form, I collect your name, phone number,
        email address, how you heard about me, and anything you write in
        your message. I don't use cookies for tracking or advertising on
        this site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">Why I collect it</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Solely to respond to your enquiry, discuss your session, and, if you
        book, to plan and deliver your shoot. Your details are never sold or
        used for anything beyond that.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">Your photos</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Your session images are not shared anywhere without your explicit
        permission. For most clients, my working copies are deleted once
        your final images have been delivered, so please keep your own
        backups. See the <a href="/terms-and-conditions" class="text-boudoir-pink underline">terms and conditions</a> for more detail.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">Keeping your information secure</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Contact form submissions come straight to my email and are treated
        with the same care as any other client communication, not shared,
        and stored securely.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        You can ask what information I hold about you, or ask me to correct
        or delete it, at any time by getting in touch through the <a href="/contact-boudoir-photography-auckland" class="text-boudoir-pink underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-boudoir-pink">Questions</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        If you have any questions about this policy, contact me directly and
        I'll be glad to talk it through.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
